  "citation": "Brown S; Gaston G (1996): Tropical Africa: Land Use, Biomass, and Carbon Estimates for 1980 (and updated for the year 2000) (NDP-055). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory, Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/LUE.NDP055",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
